# The package must ship LF: BusyBox sh on the router cannot run scripts with
# CRLF, and a Windows autocrlf checkout once produced an uninstallable ipk
# (see plans/2026-11-03-config-tab-save-fix.md). build-ipk.sh strips CR at
# staging as a second line of defense; this keeps the working tree itself LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
